BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sourdough from Scratch with Monica Flaherty at Gold Ridge Organic 
 Farms
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T130000
UID:efd5a0525aa2ae6efc40b61e18d33710@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a 3-hour hands-on sourdough making class at Gold R
 idge Organic Farms\, led by Monica Flaherty of the Sebastopol Sourdough Co
 mpany. Spend three immersive hours in our charming Apple Cottage learning 
 the art and science of sourdough bread making. Monica will walk you throug
 h everything you need to know — how wild yeast and fermentation work\, w
 hy sourdough differs from commercial yeast bread\, and how to read your do
 ugh. You'll also cover starter care and feeding\, mixing and hydration rat
 ios\, shaping and scoring techniques\, and the secrets to achieving that p
 erfect crust and open crumb. Every guest will leave with an active starter
 \, a feeding schedule and care guide\, a shaped dough in a banneton ready 
 to bake at home\, and their very own apron to take home as a keepsake. The
  experience also includes a ride across the farm on our beloved apple-them
 ed trolley to the Apple Cottage.
URL:https://business.sebastopol.org/events/details/sourdough-from-scratch-
 with-monica-flaherty-at-gold-ridge-organic-farms
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ultimate Apple Trolley Experience at Gold Ridge Organic Experience
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T140000
UID:b7d1a57218dcad6d6fa5f1591682a56f@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:If you have been waiting for the perfect moment to ride our Ap
 ple Trolley\, this is it. Savor the beauty of the changing seasons on a sc
 enic farm tour that takes you beyond the ride. During this special experie
 nce\, you will learn more about our 88-acre farm and how we grow our organ
 ic olives\, apples\, and citrus. You will also have a chance to stroll thr
 ough the orchard and meet Mark Marthaler\, who will explain his inspiratio
 n for the Apple Trolley. He will show you where he produces his other art
 —including the giant apples and vibrant butterflies dotted across our fa
 rm – and share his design secrets and inspiration that turned a simple o
 rchard ride into a living piece of art. Your ticket Includes: *A guided jo
 urney through the orchard on our Apple Trolley *An exclusive artist meet-a
 nd-greet with artist Mark Marthaler *Straus vanilla ice cream topped with 
 Gold Ridge Organic Farms Apple Cider Syrup or Meyer Lemon Citrus Oil Tours
  depart at 11am and 1pm. Tickets are limited - so book now!
URL:https://business.sebastopol.org/events/details/ultimate-apple-trolley-
 experience-at-gold-ridge-organic-experience
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
