BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Falling Leaves Festival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T150000
UID:eb77a8991aa420f96bc9376a14f734df@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:As the leaves begin to change their colors and slowly fall fro
 m the trees we welcome the return of SunRidge Charter School's beloved Fal
